      "key": "ui.source.0a029ed5a4ec",
      "text": "Not so long ago, at a university\nvery, very close by…"
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.bb3b6a1a43dd",
      "text": "A tactical shooter, a deathmatch and an alien invasion at university. Made by seven students in ten weeks, with more coffee than sleep."
