      "key": "ui.source.e80d6e8aa591",
      "text": "Note for the PO · Sprint 1"
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.49d93243ca5c",
      "text": "Hi, Amin"
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.db3b5f70585e",
      "text": "This is the Sprint 1 delivery of Project Riftwalker. Here is what already works and what is still missing so you know what to test."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.4ddad75ba8a8",
      "text": "Movement: walk, sprint, jump and crouch, with gravity, collisions and respawning if you fall off the map."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.6ce4700c7eaf",
      "text": "Weapons: La Porteña pistol, Mitre rifle and knife. Damage by hit zone (head, body and legs) and range, spread, recoil, reloading and bullet marks on walls."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.b8350f3e484c",
      "text": "Shop: buy, sell and undo purchases during the buy phase while inside the buy zone. Shields provide protection."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.704f433e9618",
      "text": "HUD: health, shield, weapon and ammunition, crosshair and hit marker. Abilities show their cooldown."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.973710256b48",
      "text": "Menus: main menu with music, video, sound and controls settings, player name, credits and pause menu (resume, restart, options and exit)."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.708bb918ebf5",
      "text": "Other weapons: the shop shows them all, but only the La Porteña pistol, Mitre and knife are currently usable. The others can be bought but cannot be used yet."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.07ea9330f86b",
      "text": "Grenades: purchasable, but cannot be thrown yet."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.9f341de02316",
      "text": "Ability: Silbato charges and appears in the HUD, but has no effect yet."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.fd23727140c4",
      "text": "Modes and multiplayer: Tactical and Deathmatch show a room, but online connectivity is still missing. Zombie does not have zombies yet: Play opens the university map to explore with weapons, the shop and the HUD."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.719ab0dcfc1e",
      "text": "Achievements: the screen exists but has no achievements yet."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.source.e963f4d7372a",
      "text": "Maps and opponents: Tests and Tests 2 open temporary maps to demonstrate gameplay. In Tests, enemies chase you and can be killed but do not attack yet."
    },
